<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--
    Archonexus module strings (src/Archonexus/). Five files contribute:
      - ArchonexusColonyState.cs         (Screen 1: choose things for new colony)
      - NewColonyTilePickState.cs        (Screen 3: choose new colony site)
      - ArchonexusReformIdeoState.cs     (Screen 4: reform ideoligion)
      - ArchonexusConvertColonistsState.cs (Screen 4 sub-dialog: assign colonists)

    Guard-style messages that exactly match Common.xml values are NOT repeated
    here — callers use those shared keys directly:
      - "World navigation not active" -> RimWorldAccess.Guard.WorldNavigationNotActive
      - "No valid tile selected"       -> RimWorldAccess.Guard.NoValidTileSelected
      - "Cannot access tile picker callbacks" -> RimWorldAccess.Gravships.Destination.CannotAccessCallbacks

    Vanilla keys referenced by the C# (ChooseNextColonySite, ChooseThingsForNewColonyTitle,
    ChooseThingsForNewColonyDesc, ConfigureIdeoligion, ChooseColonistsForIdeoTitle,
    ChooseColonistsForIdeoDesc, CreateNew, CreateFluid, LoadExistingIdeoligion,
    AssignColonists, Next, etc.) are NOT duplicated here.
  -->

  <!-- Screen 1 — opening announcement instruction fragment
       (ArchonexusColonyState.AnnounceOpening). Appended after the vanilla
       dialog title and description. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Colony.OpenInstructions>Пробіл або Enter, щоб вибрати; Alt S, щоб надіслати.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Colony.OpenInstructions>

  <!-- Screen 3 — tile pick (NewColonyTilePickState.Open).
       OpenInstructions: appended after "ChooseNextColonySite".Translate().
       MustChooseValid: spoken when the player presses Escape (cannot cancel).
       ErrorSelectingTile: spoken on exception during tile confirmation. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.TilePick.OpenInstructions>Стрілки для навігації, PageUp і PageDown для сканера, Enter для підтвердження. Скасувати не можна — потрібно обрати придатну плитку.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.TilePick.OpenInstructions>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.TilePick.MustChooseValid>Щоб продовжити, потрібно обрати придатну плитку.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.TilePick.MustChooseValid>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.TilePick.ErrorSelectingTile>Помилка вибору плитки</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.TilePick.ErrorSelectingTile>

  <!-- Screen 4 — reform ideoligion list (ArchonexusReformIdeoState).
       OpenInstructions: appended after "ConfigureIdeoligion".Translate().
       CannotCancel: spoken when the player presses Escape (the dialog cannot be cancelled).
       NoIdeoDetailsHere: spoken when Tab is pressed on a non-ideoligion row.
       AlreadyPrimary: {0} = ideoligion name.
       SetAsPrimary: {0} = ideoligion name.
       NoColonistsNeedConverting: spoken when "Assign colonists" is triggered but
         all colonists already follow the chosen ideoligion.
       ErrorConfirming: spoken on exception during the "Next" commit. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.CannotCancel>Скасувати реформування ідеології не можна. Натисніть Alt S, щоб підтвердити та продовжити.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.CannotCancel>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.AlreadyPrimary>{0} вже є основною ідеологією.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.AlreadyPrimary>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.SetAsPrimary>{0} призначено основною ідеологією.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.SetAsPrimary>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.CurrentPrimaryFragment>Поточна основна</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.CurrentPrimaryFragment>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.NoColonistsNeedConverting>Немає колоністів, яких потрібно конвертувати.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.NoColonistsNeedConverting>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.ErrorConfirming>Помилка підтвердження ідеології</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.ErrorConfirming>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.ListRegion>Ідеології</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.ListRegion>
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.DetailsRegion>Подробиці</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Reform.DetailsRegion>
  <!-- PressTabToEdit: appended to an item announcement when the focused ideoligion
       is the editable custom one and the player just returned from a sub-screen. -->

  <!-- Screen 4 sub-dialog — assign colonists (ArchonexusConvertColonistsState).
       OpenInstructions: appended after the vanilla dialog title, description,
         and pawn count.
       SpaceOrEnterToConvert: the keyboard hint in the opening announcement. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Convert.OpenInstructions>Пробіл або Enter, щоб конвертувати; Escape, коли завершите.</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Convert.OpenInstructions>

  <!-- Convert-colonists checkbox: Selected/NotSelected retired (Task 8 packet F) — the
       checked/unchecked state now rides the composer's own Checkbox state word.
       CurrentlyFollowing is the one piece NotSelectedCurrently carried that the state
       word alone cannot: which ideoligion an unconverted colonist keeps. {0} = ideoligion name. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Convert.CurrentlyFollowing>Зараз {0}</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Convert.CurrentlyFollowing>

  <!-- Colony-selection section header: how many things are selected out of the
       section's maximum ({0} = selected count, {1} = maximum). Not a cursor
       position, so it does not reuse Menu.Position. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Colony.CountOfMax>{0} з {1}</RimWorldAccess.Archonexus.Colony.CountOfMax>
</LanguageData>
